<title>SOUTH KOREA: S&amp;P rates Korea Long Term FRN notes &quot;A-&quot;.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Korea Long Term FRN notes &quot;A-&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday it has given an &quot;A-minus&quot; rating to Korea Long Term Credit Bank's A$125 million floating rate notes due December 1999.</p>
</text>
